好的，下面是一个完整的单文件扫雷游戏。直接保存为 `.html` 打开即可运行：

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>扫雷</title>
<style>
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: #1a1a2e;
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;
    color: #eee;
    user-select: none;
  }
  h1 { margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 4px; }
  .toolbar {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .info {
    background: #16213e;
    border: 1px solid #0f3460;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    min-width: 90px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  button {
    background: #e94560;
    color: #fff;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 8px 20px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform .1s, background .15s;
  }
  button:hover { background: #ff6b6b; transform: translateY(-1px); }
  button:active { transform: translateY(1px); }
  .board-wrap {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 10px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(233,69,96,.25);
  }
  .board {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2px;
    background: #0f3460;
    padding: 4px;
  }
  .cell {
    width: 38px; height: 38px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: bold;
    cursor: pointer;
    border-radius: 4px;
    transition: background .08s, transform .05s;
    position: relative;
  }
  .cell.hidden { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#16213e,#0f3460); }
  .cell.hidden:hover { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#1a2748,#133a6e); }
  .cell.revealed { background: #0d1b2a; cursor: default; }
  .cell.flagged { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#16213e,#0f3460); cursor: pointer; }
  .cell.flagged::after { content:'🚩'; font-size: 1.2rem; }
  .cell.mine { background: #e94560 !important; animation: pop .2s; }
  .cell.exploded { background: #ff4757 !important; animation: boom .3s; }
  .cell.safe { background: #11c26e; }
  @keyframes pop { 0%{transform:scale(.5)} 100%{transform:scale(1)} }
  @keyframes boom { 0%{transform:scale(1)} 50%{transform:scale(1.3)} 100%{transform:scale(1)} }
  .overlay {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,.6);
    border-radius: 10px;
    opacity: 0; pointer-events: none;
    transition: opacity .25s;
  }
  .overlay.show { opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto; }
  .overlay span {
    font-size: 2rem; font-weight: bold;
    background: #16213e; padding: 16px 32px;
    border-radius: 10px; border: 2px solid #e94560;
  }
</style>
</head>
